# AI QA Academy UI

- Stack: Next.js 15, React 19, Tailwind v4, Shadcn-style `components/ui`, Framer Motion, Shiki.
- Content must reflect Playwright-ZR **Python** facts (`site/`, `pages/`, `api/`, `ai/`). Do not invent TypeScript API frameworks or LangTools demos absent from the repo.
- Prefer OKLCH tokens in `app/globals.css` `@theme`; keep the dark cyber/cyan academy aesthetic.
- No `any` in TypeScript. Explicit props interfaces for components.
- Marketing lives in `components/marketing`; learn features in `components/features`; primitives in `components/ui`.
- When adding lessons, extend `lib/curriculum.ts` and keep tip bullets grounded in runnable tests.
